                        <div class="conTxt"> 
      
     <p style="margin-top:20px;text-align:right"><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 140%; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 40px;">各区、县(市)教研室(教师发展中心)、教育技术中心，市直</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 140%; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 140%; letter-spacing: -2px; font-size: 40px;">学校：</span>
</p><p style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:1px;margin-left:16px;text-indent:86px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:137%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">为进一步推进基础教育课程改革，促进学校扎实开展</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">各类学</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 40px">生学习活动，引导学生学习方式的变革，培养学生学以致用、综</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">合解决实际问题的能力，经研究，决定举行</span>2</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px">026年绍兴市中小</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 40px">学生综合素养展示比赛，现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p><p style="margin-top:1px;margin-left:97px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">一、比赛项目</span></p><p style="margin-top:26px;margin-left:16px;text-indent:86px;line-height:139%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 139%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">中小学综合实践活动、青少年模拟政协活动、高中生涯规划</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 139%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 139%;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 40px">活动、中小学生数字素养提升实践活动。</span></p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-left:98px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">二、比赛内容及要求</span></p><p><span style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 80px; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 40px;">    2026年9月前结题的个人或小组合作产生的学生学习活动</span><span style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 80px; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 80px; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">成果，已在市级及以上单位举办的评比中获奖的成果不再参加评</span><span style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 80px; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="text-align: justify; text-indent: 80px; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">比。具体评比内容要求如下：</span>
</p><p style="margin-top:0;margin-left:99px"><span style="font-family: 楷体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 41px">(一)中小学综合实践活动</span></p><p style="margin-top:25px;text-indent:80px;line-height:137%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 40px">此项评审由原中小学生研究性学习成果评比与综合实践活</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 40px">动成果评比整合。成果材料应如实反映学生在某一主题活动中，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">通过多种实践学习方式</span>(考察探究、设计制作、</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">社会服务、职业</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">体验、场馆学习、团队活动等</span>)取得的学习成果和真实体验记录。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">内容丰富，思路清晰，记录完整。</span></p><p style="margin-top:3px;margin-right:17px;text-indent:80px;line-height:125%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">1.   </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">申报主体：成果作者应是学生，由学生独立完成或在教</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">师指导下完成。成果报告可以署集体名，也可以署主要作者的名</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: 3px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">字</span>(不多于6个)。指导老师不超过2个。</span></p><p style="margin-top:23px;margin-right:14px;text-indent:80px;line-height:126%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 41px">2.   </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 41px">成果内容：成果以跨学科研究性学习成果报告和社会实</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 41px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 41px">践成果报告的形式为主。学生成果报告由题目、摘要、正文、参</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 41px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 41px">考文献构成。其中正文包含背景与意义、过程与方法、结果与分</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 41px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 41px">析、结论与讨论四个部分。成果报告中需要</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 41px">体现对活动过程和结</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;font-size: 41px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 41px">果的系统梳理和有效反思。成果报告格式可参考省编教学用书与</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 41px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 126%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 41px">教师用书中的学生成果报告样例。</span></p><p style="margin-top:29px;margin-right:26px;text-indent:80px;line-height:114%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 114%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 41px">3.   </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 114%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 41px">字数限定：成果主体报告应简洁明了，注意控制字数，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 114%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 41px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 114%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 41px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">小学</span>2000字以内，初中3000字以内，高中4000字以内。</span></p><p style="margin-top:26px;margin-right:17px;text-indent:80px;line-height:113%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 113%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">4.   </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 113%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">成果附件：上报成果时，应将学生所写的研究记录、反</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 113%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 113%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">思日志、心得笔记等文本、实物作品照片和实践过程中的记录单</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 132%; letter-spacing: -2px; font-size: 41px;">等相关事实性材料作为佐证上交。附件总页数一般情况控制在</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 132%; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 41px;"> </span><span style="font-family: "Times New Roman"; line-height: 132%; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 41px;">A4 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 132%; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 41px;">纸15页以内。</span></p><p style="margin-top:5px;margin-right:10px;text-indent:80px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:137%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px">5.  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px">成果来源：征集的成果是学校和教师</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">根据教育部</span>2017年</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 40px">版《中小学综合实践活动课程指导纲要》中综合实践活动课程的</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 40px">目标、内容、方式，组织开展课程活动过程中指导学生形成的相</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">关成果。</span></p><p style="margin-top:3px;margin-left:99px"><span style="font-family: 楷体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 41px">(二)青少年模拟政协活动</span></p><p style="margin-top:21px;margin-left:80px"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 40px">此项评审主要包括提案集中展示、模拟新闻发布两项内容。</span></p><p style="margin-top:23px;margin-right:17px;text-indent:80px;line-height:125%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">1.提案集中展示：包括视频展示、提案陈述(同时展示 </span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">PPT)</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">和现场答辩三个环节，共</span>12分钟，其中视频展示</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px">和答辩不超过</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 125%;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 125%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px">5分钟。</span></p><p style="margin-top:26px;margin-right:1px;text-indent:80px;line-height:128%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 40px">2.</span><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">   </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">模拟新闻发布：各提案小组派出</span>1名新闻发言人(一般</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">由组长担任</span>),以“政协委员”的角色，模拟人民政协新闻发布会，</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">进行</span>5分钟内的新闻发布，向模拟的各界媒体记者介绍提案，并</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">进行</span>5分钟内的“模拟记者”提问和回答。同时，各提案小组安排</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 40px">1名学生担任各大媒体的“模拟记者”。</span></p><p style="margin-top:26px;text-indent:80px;line-height:135%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 135%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 41px">集中展示前，各模拟政协小组自行完成调查报告。报告内容</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 135%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 41px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 135%;letter-spacing: -3px;font-size: 41px">主要包括四个部分：研究背景、存在问题、原因分析和对策建议。</span></p><p style="margin-top:1px;margin-left:99px"><span style="font-family: 楷体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 41px">(三)高中生涯规划活动</span></p><p style="margin-top:23px;margin-right:11px;text-indent:80px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:135%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 135%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 41px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">此项评审主要内容为生涯规划书大赛，</span>7月份进行初赛，初</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 135%;font-size: 41px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 135%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 41px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">赛成绩前</span>40%进入10月份的决赛。决赛</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 135%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 41px">环节由主题陈述、现场</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 135%;font-size: 41px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 135%;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 41px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">答辩两部分组成，每位选手主题陈述环节限时</span>10分钟，现场答</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 40px;">辩环节限时5分钟。主题可以从职业规划或学业规划两</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 40px;">个角度切</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">入，内容既要有可操作性，同时能够反映当代中学生积极进取的</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 138%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">精神风貌，题目自拟。</span></p><p style="margin-left:98px"><span style="font-family: 楷体;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 41px">(四)中小学生数字素养提升实践活动</span></p><p style="margin-top:26px;margin-right:6px;text-indent:80px;text-align:justify;text-justify:inter-ideograph;line-height:137%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">此项评审主要包括数字艺术与计算思维、智能机器人、创客</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">三大项目。其中，数字艺术与计算思维项目，</span>3月份进行初赛及</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">现场复赛；智能机器人和创客项目，</span>4月份进行现场赛。具体任</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 40px">务说明及比赛相关事项详见绍兴市教育技术中心补</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 137%;letter-spacing: -0;font-size: 40px">充通知。</span></p><p style="margin-top:6px;margin-left:80px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 37px">三、报送数量及要求</span></p><p style="margin-top:25px;margin-left:80px"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 40px">1.   </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">区、县</span>(市)报送上限</span></p><p style="margin-top:25px;margin-left:80px"><img src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/xwzx/2026/6/202606291027074278.png" style="max-width: 100%; width: 587px; height: 374px;" title="202606291027074278.png" width="587" height="374" alt="202606291027074278.png" /><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 40px"> </span></p><p><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 40px">2. 报送截止时间：2026年10月30日(其中青少年模拟政</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">协活动</span>6月前完成)。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 40px; color: rgb(255, 0, 0);">本校10月26日前上报至沈初见老师，逾期不候。</span></p><p style="margin-top:26px;text-indent:80px;line-height:116%"><span style="text-align: right; font-family: "Times New Roman"; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 40px;">3.   </span><span style="text-align: right; font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 40px;">成果封面标明成果名称、活动实施时间、作者(小</span><span style="text-align: right; font-family: 仿宋; letter-spacing: 1px; font-size: 40px;">组成</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 40px;">员)、学校、班级、指导老师及联系方式。内容正文用小四号宋</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: 0px; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 40px;">体，标题用小三号黑体；行间距为固定值22磅。</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 40px;">采用</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: "Times New Roman"; line-height: 137%; font-size: 40px;">Word</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: "Times New Roman"; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: 2px; font-size: 40px;">文</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 137%; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">档</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: -9px; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">，</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: "Times New Roman"; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">A4</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: "Times New Roman"; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: 4px; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">纸，页边距设置上、下为2.54</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: "Times New Roman"; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">cm,</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: "Times New Roman"; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: -5px; font-size: 40px;"> </span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 仿宋; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">左、右为2.2</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: "Times New Roman"; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">cm</span><span style="text-align: justify; font-family: 宋体; line-height: 137%; letter-spacing: -1px; font-size: 40px;">。</span></p><p style="margin-top:5px;margin-right:1px;text-indent:79px;line-height:128%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">4.   </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">参评的成果材料以纸质稿和电子稿两种形式同时报送。</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">其中，纸质一式四份</span>(其中3份不出现单位名称、作者和指导教 </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">师姓名等相关信息</span>);报告、附件、承诺书、汇总</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px">表电子稿各一</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">份，由各区、县</span>(市)教研室在评比的基础上，统一报送我院各</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 128%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">项目联络人</span>(见附件1)。</span></p><p style="margin-top:28px;text-indent:79px;line-height:123%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 123%;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 40px">5.   </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 123%;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">请各区、县</span>(市)教研室、教师发展中心(教育研究中</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 123%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 123%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">心</span>)、教育技术中心认真组织，落实专人负责完成，逾期视自动</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 123%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 123%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">放弃。</span></p><p style="margin-top:25px;margin-left:79px"><span style="font-family: 黑体;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 39px">四、评审办法</span></p><p style="margin-top:25px;margin-right:8px;text-indent:79px;line-height:117%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 117%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">1.  </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 117%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">本次评审按参评成果篇目总数的</span>80%取奖，以2:3:</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 117%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">5的比</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 117%;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 117%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">例设一、二、三等奖。</span></p><p style="margin-top:24px;margin-right:6px;text-indent:79px;line-height:116%"><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 116%;letter-spacing: 2px;font-size: 40px">2.青少年模拟政协评审(具体通知另发)设一等奖9名(初</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 116%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 116%;letter-spacing: 5px;font-size: 40px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">中</span>3名),二等奖11名(初中3名)。</span></p><p style="margin-top:18px;margin-right:6px;text-indent:79px;line-height:114%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 114%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 43px">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 114%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 43px">中小学生数字素养提升实践活动评审按不超过实际参赛</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 114%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 43px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 114%;letter-spacing: -2px;font-size: 43px"><span style="font-family:仿宋">总数的</span>75%取奖，以2:3:5的比例设一、二、三等奖。</span></p><p style="margin-top:23px;margin-right:4px;text-indent:79px;line-height:112%"><span style="font-family: 'Times New Roman';line-height: 112%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">4.   </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 112%;letter-spacing: 0;font-size: 40px">市教育教学研究院、市教育技术中心根据职能各自聘请</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 112%;letter-spacing: 1px;font-size: 40px"> </span><span style="font-family: 仿宋;line-height: 112%;letter-spacing: -1px;font-size: 40px">评委组织开展评审工作。</span></p><p><span style="font-family: Arial;font-size: 14px">
